   "updated": 1786843171791,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Important:\nthe cache is used only\nif Masters, Elite AND\nAmateur all have cached\nrows.\n\nIf even one of the three\nis missing, the code\nfetches all three again.\nIt does not reuse the\nother cached databases.",
   "rawText": "Important:\nthe cache is used only\nif Masters, Elite AND\nAmateur all have cached\nrows.\n\nIf even one of the three\nis missing, the code\nfetches all three again.\nIt does not reuse the\nother cached databases.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
